WEBVTT

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:32.976
Now, the world needs opportunities
for new leaders and new ideas.

00:07:33.000 --> 00:07:35.976
Kids need opportunities
to lead and succeed.

00:07:36.296 --> 00:07:38.161
Are you ready to make the match?

00:07:38.510 --> 00:07:43.121
Because the world's problems
shouldn't be the human family's heirloom.

00:07:43.145 --> 00:07:44.976
Thank you.

00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:47.976
(Applause)

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:50.000
Thank you. Thank you.